### Create a match (replace with actual IDs)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/matches
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer :token

{
  "matchDateId": 1,
  "homeClubId": 1,
  "awayClubId": 4,
  "scheduledTime": "2026-09-16T16:00:00"
}

### Create another match
POST http://localhost:8080/api/matches
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "matchDateId": 2,
  "homeClubId": 1,
  "awayClubId": 2,
  "scheduledTime": "2026-03-22T18:00:00"
}

### Get matches by match date (replace with actual match date ID)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/matches?matchDateId=REPLACE_WITH_MATCH_DATE_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get matches by club (replace with actual club ID)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/matches?clubId=REPLACE_WITH_CLUB_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get match by ID (replace with actual ID)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/matches/REPLACE_WITH_MATCH_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
